WEBVTT

00:01.084 --> 00:03.253
Do you know why you don't get math?

00:03.336 --> 00:04.838
FINAL EXAM
IN 16 DAYS

00:04.921 --> 00:06.923
Because you don't know the logic.

00:07.716 --> 00:10.760
You memorize everything
without knowing the reason behind it.

00:17.267 --> 00:18.184
Oh Beom-seok.

00:18.935 --> 00:20.645
Class is almost over.

00:21.396 --> 00:22.313
I'm sorry.

00:24.315 --> 00:25.358
Anyway,

00:25.442 --> 00:29.904
everyone should think hard
about why I told you this today.

00:30.572 --> 00:31.614
Class president.

00:31.698 --> 00:33.324
Attention. Bow.

00:34.242 --> 00:35.577
Thank you.

00:41.541 --> 00:42.375
Beom-seok.

00:44.627 --> 00:45.879
Did you go drinking?

00:47.297 --> 00:48.131
Beom-seok!

00:49.257 --> 00:50.175
You good?

00:56.139 --> 00:57.307
Your head killing you?

00:57.891 --> 01:00.226
Yeah, and my guts aren't too good either.

01:02.979 --> 01:03.813
Hey.

01:04.355 --> 01:06.357
I can't remember how it ended.

01:07.484 --> 01:09.652
You were fucking funny last night.

01:09.736 --> 01:12.697
And that punk Yong-jin
definitely banged that girl.

01:13.198 --> 01:14.115
Seriously?

01:14.199 --> 01:15.700
Yeah! Don't you remember?

01:16.284 --> 01:17.952
You paid for the motel.

01:18.036 --> 01:19.621
- I paid for it?
- Yeah!

01:19.704 --> 01:21.706
- Dude!
- He really doesn't remember.

01:22.540 --> 01:23.792
Let's go for a smoke.

01:24.292 --> 01:25.794
Thanks for the drinks.

01:25.877 --> 01:28.838
Seriously, last night was really fun.

01:56.282 --> 02:01.412
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:59.137 --> 03:00.388
What group are we in?

03:02.432 --> 03:03.266
Group six.

03:03.766 --> 03:05.185
The seat at the end is mine.

03:11.566 --> 03:14.277
Oh Beom didn't come to school yet?

03:18.907 --> 03:20.408
- He came.
- He did?

03:20.992 --> 03:22.118
When?

03:22.202 --> 03:25.997
Beom-seok, that girl couldn't keep
her hands off your legs last night!

03:29.751 --> 03:31.753
Man, I was wondering.

03:31.836 --> 03:33.004
- About what?
- Hey.

03:33.087 --> 03:35.256
You rapped in English at karaoke.

03:35.340 --> 03:36.716
It was fucking wild.

03:36.799 --> 03:39.010
You got some pent-up rage or what?

03:39.093 --> 03:39.928
Let's go again.

03:40.011 --> 03:41.763
Just us without Yong-jin.

03:41.846 --> 03:44.849
Yeah. Yong-jin totally stole
that girl from you.

03:48.102 --> 03:49.187
Let's have a chat.

03:53.900 --> 03:54.734
What is this?

03:56.611 --> 03:57.445
What's what?

03:59.614 --> 04:01.074
Why did you ignore my calls?

04:04.869 --> 04:06.037
I didn't know you called.

04:09.207 --> 04:10.291
What's with them?

04:11.834 --> 04:15.213
Why are you suddenly friends
with Jeong-chan and Tae-hun?

04:20.760 --> 04:22.178
It's none of your business.

04:28.434 --> 04:30.395
You, Su-ho, and I should talk.

04:31.396 --> 04:32.605
I have nothing to say.

04:37.694 --> 04:40.154
That bastard Su-ho looked down on me
from the start.

04:41.281 --> 04:44.075
The bastard never saw me as a friend.

04:44.158 --> 04:46.160
I was just a lackey to him.

05:00.925 --> 05:02.969
You're talking behind my back now?

05:10.685 --> 05:11.769
So what?

05:38.296 --> 05:40.548
Drink!

05:42.258 --> 05:43.259
Great job!

05:46.763 --> 05:47.597
What's up?

05:48.389 --> 05:49.515
Beom-seok.

05:50.558 --> 05:51.559
Long time no see.

05:53.728 --> 05:55.730
Yeah, it's been a while.

05:56.731 --> 05:58.649
- Come here.
- Sit here, Beom-seok.

06:06.783 --> 06:09.327
This is Oh Beom-seok,
a friend from my old school.

06:09.410 --> 06:10.745
Assemblyman Oh Jin-won's son.

06:10.828 --> 06:11.662
Who's that?

06:11.746 --> 06:14.374
You know, that National Assembly guy.

06:15.625 --> 06:17.460
Oh, really?

06:17.543 --> 06:18.378
Awesome!

06:18.461 --> 06:20.463
Meet Seo-hyeon, Ji-an, and Su-a.

06:21.214 --> 06:22.715
Friends from my new school.

06:22.799 --> 06:24.133
And Kang Woo-yeong.

06:24.217 --> 06:26.219
A future UFC fighter and my friend.

06:28.096 --> 06:29.847
You know Physical Therapist Woo-yeong?

06:30.765 --> 06:32.433
What physical therapy?

06:32.517 --> 06:33.559
Look it up later.

06:33.643 --> 06:37.146
It's an online channel where he spars
with dumbass posers.

06:37.230 --> 06:38.356
It's fucking funny.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.108
Hey, man.

06:42.443 --> 06:44.153
Yeah, nice to meet you.

06:47.657 --> 06:48.741
Oh, right.

06:48.825 --> 06:51.285
I heard you split from those fuckers,
Si-eun and Su-ho.

06:53.037 --> 06:54.247
- Yes.
- What happened?

06:54.872 --> 06:56.082
You guys were tight.

06:58.459 --> 07:00.962
Su-ho thinks he's the fucking king.

07:01.546 --> 07:03.714
Yeah, that guy fucking sucks.

07:05.007 --> 07:06.717
He looks down on everyone.

07:07.927 --> 07:10.346
I need to beat the hell
out of that fucker someday.

07:13.141 --> 07:13.975
Anyway,

07:15.059 --> 07:16.310
sorry about before.

07:22.108 --> 07:23.234
Let's drink!

07:23.317 --> 07:24.277
Drink!

07:24.360 --> 07:26.279
- Drink up!
- Cheers!

07:26.362 --> 07:28.072
Fuck, I want to transfer too.

07:31.492 --> 07:33.077
Isn't he your type?

07:34.954 --> 07:37.206
Some experts…

07:38.666 --> 07:41.127
What did they estimate?

07:41.711 --> 07:45.590
DAESUNG ACADEMY

07:48.134 --> 07:49.010
Hey, Si-eun!

08:01.022 --> 08:01.856
What is it?

08:02.440 --> 08:03.399
It's Friday!

08:04.484 --> 08:05.943
Let's ride all night.

08:06.819 --> 08:07.653
Get on.

08:17.538 --> 08:18.372
It's cute.

08:44.690 --> 08:45.525
Apartment 901.

08:46.108 --> 08:48.361
Think of it as training. Take the stairs.

08:50.655 --> 08:51.739
Are you making me work?

08:51.822 --> 08:55.076
It's not like that.
I'm just helping you get stronger.

08:58.829 --> 09:00.039
I'll be back soon.

09:05.878 --> 09:06.837
Cheers!

09:12.552 --> 09:13.386
Killer, right?

09:26.107 --> 09:27.692
How is Yeong-i's new job going?

09:28.234 --> 09:32.280
Yeah, she's actually quite smart,
and she's friendly with people.

09:40.955 --> 09:41.914
I think that…

09:44.458 --> 09:47.086
Jeong-chan and Tae-hun
are taking advantage of Beom-seok.

09:50.506 --> 09:51.340
And?

09:52.758 --> 09:55.261
I think he's buying them
shoes and clothes.

09:56.429 --> 09:58.806
He pays for all their drinks too.

10:01.225 --> 10:02.643
He always reeks of booze.

10:05.563 --> 10:07.315
Maybe Oh Beom's using them.

10:10.776 --> 10:11.611
It's just

10:12.403 --> 10:14.488
he wanted that from the start.

10:15.823 --> 10:17.700
That's why he latched on to us.

10:18.284 --> 10:20.036
He wanted to be popular.

10:22.955 --> 10:24.915
He thought
we made him look like a big shot.

10:30.546 --> 10:32.006
Do you really think so?

10:47.104 --> 10:48.189
Had a fun weekend?

10:48.272 --> 10:50.399
Yeong-bin brought some hotties.

10:50.483 --> 10:51.984
Fucking traitors!

10:52.818 --> 10:54.737
- I'll go out with one.
- For real?

10:55.279 --> 10:57.823
Stop daydreaming, you fucking moron!

10:57.907 --> 11:00.743
It's true love.
Her eyes sparkled when she looked at me.

11:00.826 --> 11:02.662
'Cause you look old for high school!

11:02.745 --> 11:04.080
You look like a little kid.

11:04.163 --> 11:06.540
- Want to take this outside?
- Bring it on.

11:07.708 --> 11:09.168
Seo-hyeon messaged me.

11:09.669 --> 11:11.295
- No way, man.
- Seo-hyeon?

11:11.379 --> 11:12.880
- Knock it off!
- Why would she?

11:12.963 --> 11:14.465
She slid into my DMs.

11:14.548 --> 11:16.926
She messaged me first and asked me out.

11:17.009 --> 11:18.469
- For real?
- Yeah.

11:18.552 --> 11:20.179
- Yeah, right.
- Can we come meet her?

11:20.262 --> 11:21.889
- What about me?
- Not this guy.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.057
No way!

11:23.140 --> 11:25.226
- Ask her to bring Su-a.
- What about us?

11:25.309 --> 11:26.143
I'll ask her.

11:26.227 --> 11:28.521
- Ji-an! No, not Ji-an.
- What about us?

11:28.604 --> 11:30.314
- Ask Su-a for me.
- Three is enough.

11:30.398 --> 11:32.149
- And us too?
- Her pics are hot!

11:34.193 --> 11:36.195
- Message her!
- Nah, later.

11:37.780 --> 11:39.156
Seriously?

11:39.240 --> 11:40.700
Are you coming over here now?

11:42.034 --> 11:42.952
Fine!

11:52.670 --> 11:53.963
- Beom-seok.
- I'm fed up!

11:54.046 --> 11:55.005
What?

11:55.089 --> 11:56.257
- Su-a, again?
- Yeah.

11:56.340 --> 11:58.217
Of course! Please message her.

11:58.300 --> 11:59.635
Nice seat, isn't it?

12:00.136 --> 12:01.554
It's awesome.

12:02.471 --> 12:04.140
The rent is 100 million won.

12:05.141 --> 12:06.434
Buy me something big.

12:06.934 --> 12:09.061
- I'll treat you this weekend.
- Bet!

12:09.562 --> 12:10.646
But not Tae-hun.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.481
I won't go then.

12:12.565 --> 12:14.859
Come on. We need you for the ugly girl.

12:16.402 --> 12:17.695
Stop using Beom-seok.

12:18.404 --> 12:19.238
What?

12:20.781 --> 12:22.324
Don't take advantage of him.

12:23.909 --> 12:25.786
What is this bullshit?

12:26.746 --> 12:28.372
School is so scary now.

12:28.956 --> 12:31.167
You buy shoes and drink alcohol

12:32.251 --> 12:33.669
using Beom-seok's cash.

12:33.753 --> 12:36.046
Fuck, you say that
like we're the bad guys.

12:36.130 --> 12:36.964
Hey.

12:37.548 --> 12:39.675
If he wants to pay, what's the problem?

12:41.761 --> 12:42.845
I've said my piece.

12:55.608 --> 12:56.901
Let's go eat.

13:13.542 --> 13:15.044
Don't worry about Beom-seok.

13:17.463 --> 13:18.297
What?

13:19.256 --> 13:21.050
You've done enough. You tried.

13:26.222 --> 13:27.598
I think Beom-seok…

13:30.392 --> 13:31.977
is just lonely.

13:35.022 --> 13:36.190
I'm not sure.

13:37.942 --> 13:38.943
Just a feeling.

13:43.697 --> 13:45.157
What's for lunch?

13:46.116 --> 13:47.868
Shit, perilla leaves?

13:47.952 --> 13:49.954
Who wants to feed them to me?

13:54.750 --> 13:55.626
Hey!

14:00.214 --> 14:01.298
Hey!

14:07.513 --> 14:08.556
What are you doing?

14:09.640 --> 14:10.599
There's a line.

14:23.779 --> 14:24.947
Get in line.

15:06.780 --> 15:07.907
I don't get it.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.581
Get in line, Beom-seok.

15:25.382 --> 15:26.383
I don't want to.

15:38.145 --> 15:39.063
Enough.

15:47.404 --> 15:48.614
Goddamn it.

16:08.759 --> 16:09.635
Let's go.

16:23.440 --> 16:24.733
Are you fucking serious?

16:24.817 --> 16:28.445
Fucking hell! That asshole has no respect.

16:32.533 --> 16:33.367
Hey.

16:34.994 --> 16:36.870
Do you know anyone who can waste him?

16:37.454 --> 16:38.664
- What?
- I can pay.

16:38.747 --> 16:40.749
Can anyone kill that bastard?

16:43.544 --> 16:44.795
Oh fuck!

16:45.504 --> 16:47.256
- What?
- Woo-yeong.

16:48.007 --> 16:50.592
I watched some of his videos
on his channel.

16:50.676 --> 16:51.802
He's fucking good.

16:53.679 --> 16:56.098
PHYSICAL THERAPIST WOO-YEONG

16:56.181 --> 16:58.142
- That's it.
- Fuck, this could work.

16:58.225 --> 16:59.143
He could do it.

17:01.812 --> 17:03.063
He throws good punches.

17:06.650 --> 17:07.818
How much can you pay?

17:14.033 --> 17:15.534
Is a million won enough?

17:23.834 --> 17:24.668
When?

17:29.590 --> 17:30.549
This Saturday.

17:33.427 --> 17:34.428
Su-ho's birthday.

17:36.805 --> 17:37.806
All right.

17:40.225 --> 17:41.977
I'll live stream it. Unedited.

17:48.192 --> 17:49.777
- Where are you going?
- The gym.

17:51.195 --> 17:52.196
That's diligence.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.116
Hold on.

17:57.534 --> 18:01.205
Didn't Ahn Su-ho waste him
a while back in a competition?

18:01.747 --> 18:03.624
Hey, that was a long time ago.

18:04.374 --> 18:06.668
Su-ho retired. Woo-yeong still fights.

18:07.211 --> 18:09.004
- No problem.
- Hey.

18:10.130 --> 18:12.508
Make him fight with a handicap
if you're so worried.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.179
Am I wrong?

18:48.252 --> 18:50.003
Hey, isn't this it?

18:51.839 --> 18:54.424
I think this is it. Let me see.

18:54.508 --> 18:56.677
Here we go. Fuck.

18:57.803 --> 18:58.971
It's hard to cut!

19:04.143 --> 19:05.269
I hope that's the one.

19:06.687 --> 19:09.022
Fuck, couldn't this really kill him?

19:09.606 --> 19:11.358
Don't know. Don't care.

19:28.000 --> 19:28.834
Shit!

19:43.348 --> 19:44.725
Look out!

19:49.771 --> 19:50.606
What was that?

19:57.112 --> 19:58.989
Hey, are you all right?

19:59.698 --> 20:01.867
- Please call an ambulance.
- I'm calling now.

20:02.826 --> 20:03.911
Can you move?

20:05.162 --> 20:05.996
Hey.

20:06.496 --> 20:08.415
Let's go before we get screwed.

20:13.086 --> 20:14.004
Hey, Beom-seok!

20:14.546 --> 20:15.505
Hurry up!

20:28.769 --> 20:30.062
- I'm okay.
- Are you sure?

20:31.063 --> 20:31.980
I'm all right.

20:33.023 --> 20:34.650
Shouldn't you go to the hospital?

20:35.651 --> 20:39.154
Now, what did I tell you
about Song of the Green Mountain?

20:46.495 --> 20:47.621
You just got here?

20:48.956 --> 20:50.082
I'm sorry.

20:51.667 --> 20:53.835
Eyes up here!

20:55.504 --> 20:57.256
I'll go over it one last time.

20:59.007 --> 21:02.177
A trimeter song with stanzas and a chorus.

21:02.719 --> 21:06.056
This song demonstrates
the most basic elements

21:06.139 --> 21:07.724
of the Goryeo period…

21:26.910 --> 21:28.161
What happened?

21:28.245 --> 21:29.329
It's no big deal.

21:31.665 --> 21:32.499
Hey.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.171
Don't look at me.

21:40.007 --> 21:41.008
You make me sick.

21:44.261 --> 21:45.095
Get lost.

21:51.310 --> 21:52.144
What was that?

21:54.146 --> 21:54.980
Nothing.

22:03.947 --> 22:06.241
Shit, that fucking scared me.

22:06.992 --> 22:08.994
Do you think he knows it was us?

22:09.077 --> 22:10.537
How could he?

22:11.288 --> 22:13.457
I hope not. I mean, there's no way.

22:13.540 --> 22:15.625
Is his birthday the day after tomorrow?

22:17.294 --> 22:18.128
It's done!

22:21.548 --> 22:24.718
If Su-ho hadn't gotten hurt,
we would've gone to Yangyang.

22:26.094 --> 22:27.012
Take pictures.

22:29.306 --> 22:30.349
Take nice ones.

22:31.975 --> 22:34.144
People will think it's your birthday.

22:39.232 --> 22:40.150
Hurry up.

23:04.424 --> 23:05.384
Still no answer?

23:06.635 --> 23:07.469
No.

23:11.473 --> 23:13.392
Maybe he blocked you.

23:13.475 --> 23:15.727
The number you have called
cannot be reached…

23:25.070 --> 23:26.029
What's your problem?

23:29.324 --> 23:30.158
Nothing.

23:37.082 --> 23:38.041
Hey.

23:38.125 --> 23:41.211
He won't be here for 30 minutes.

23:41.711 --> 23:44.005
Why are you cooking seaweed soup already?

23:44.673 --> 23:46.883
I heard it tastes better
if you cook it longer.

23:48.135 --> 23:49.386
Says who?

23:49.469 --> 23:51.054
MY BUDDY SI-EUN, LOOK HERE

23:52.097 --> 23:54.933
BEOM-SEOK: ARE YOU AT THE PARTY ROOM?

23:58.645 --> 24:00.355
ARE YOU AT THE PARTY ROOM?

24:00.439 --> 24:03.150
I'M NEARBY. CAN I SEE YOU A MINUTE?

24:04.276 --> 24:05.110
Hey.

24:06.236 --> 24:08.363
Didn't you cut ties with Beom-seok?

24:12.826 --> 24:13.785
Su-ho said that?

24:13.869 --> 24:15.579
IT'S SU-HO'S BIRTHDAY TODAY

24:15.662 --> 24:16.997
No, he didn't.

24:18.373 --> 24:20.792
Why are you suddenly asking about him?

24:21.960 --> 24:23.962
DON'T TELL SI-EUN OR SU-HO

24:24.045 --> 24:26.673
COME OUT FOR A MINUTE
SO I CAN GIVE YOU HIS PRESENT

24:31.178 --> 24:32.679
Oh? It's nothing.

24:34.848 --> 24:36.141
I'm going to the shop.

24:45.942 --> 24:47.068
It's been a while.

24:48.069 --> 24:48.987
How's it going?

24:51.490 --> 24:52.782
Good, I guess.

24:55.368 --> 24:56.244
How about you?

24:57.412 --> 24:58.246
Fine.

24:58.830 --> 24:59.998
Sorry about before.

25:01.750 --> 25:04.252
I caused problems by answering your phone.

25:05.629 --> 25:07.506
Si-eun was so worried about you.

25:09.007 --> 25:12.385
Su-ho will be here soon.
So come to the party with me.

25:12.469 --> 25:13.970
I'll help you guys make up.

25:21.561 --> 25:22.437
Hey.

25:23.730 --> 25:24.564
First of all,

25:25.732 --> 25:27.484
you didn't cause problems.

25:30.028 --> 25:31.404
And what can you do?

25:34.950 --> 25:37.452
And why would we make up?

25:40.747 --> 25:42.582
Is he for real?

25:53.468 --> 25:54.302
What is this?

26:01.017 --> 26:02.185
If you go that way…

26:03.311 --> 26:05.647
Don't play so methodically. Look.

26:05.730 --> 26:08.233
This isn't studying. It's a game.

26:09.901 --> 26:10.902
Okay, my turn.

26:15.490 --> 26:18.118
Hey, is Yeong-i crawling or something?

26:18.201 --> 26:19.953
Why's it taking so long? I'm starving.

26:21.746 --> 26:23.373
We can have the cake later.

26:23.456 --> 26:24.708
Let's just eat first.

26:28.878 --> 26:29.713
You seriously…

26:31.965 --> 26:33.758
had a great idea. I mean it.

26:33.842 --> 26:35.010
I like it.

26:37.512 --> 26:39.431
- I'll try calling Yeong-i.
- Okay.

26:46.938 --> 26:50.817
The number you called cannot be reached.
Leave a message after the beep.

26:51.359 --> 26:53.903
Did you know
reheated leftover pizza is hella tasty?

26:53.987 --> 26:54.821
Get ready.

26:54.904 --> 26:56.489
It'll blow your mind.

27:12.422 --> 27:14.424
BEOM-SEOK
18-3 BAMGOGAE-RO, GANGNAM, SEOUL

27:14.507 --> 27:16.968
STOP IGNORING MY CALLS AND GET OVER HERE

27:24.601 --> 27:27.062
Don't look at me. You make me sick.

27:29.439 --> 27:31.691
Hey, now Yeong-i isn't a problem.

27:31.775 --> 27:34.319
Hey. Didn't you cut ties with Beom-seok?

27:34.402 --> 27:35.528
I'm going to the shop.

27:37.572 --> 27:39.115
Hurry up and take a seat.

27:39.866 --> 27:41.868
This smells great. Holy shit.

27:44.162 --> 27:45.288
YOUR BIRTHDAY PRESENT LOL

27:45.372 --> 27:47.624
Hell yeah, check out this cheese.

27:51.920 --> 27:52.754
So good.

27:52.837 --> 27:53.880
Start without me.

27:56.132 --> 27:56.966
Okay.

27:59.594 --> 28:01.846
I also want chicken, but I'll resist.

28:01.930 --> 28:03.598
You know what I mean?

28:04.182 --> 28:06.768
ON MY WAY. WAIT FOR ME

28:09.020 --> 28:10.605
DELETE 6 MESSAGES

28:12.691 --> 28:14.025
BEOM-SEOK IS BLOCKED

28:14.693 --> 28:15.944
SLIDE TO POWER OFF

28:23.868 --> 28:25.870
- I'm going to the shop.
- Right now?

28:26.621 --> 28:27.455
Hey.

28:31.626 --> 28:32.460
Hurry up.

28:33.336 --> 28:35.463
I can't wait more than five minutes.

28:37.424 --> 28:38.258
Be right back.

28:38.967 --> 28:39.843
Go ahead and eat.

28:52.939 --> 28:54.357
Damn, I need a smoke.

28:57.819 --> 28:59.904
Su-ho wouldn't answer my calls,

29:00.405 --> 29:02.657
but he's coming now
after seeing your picture.

29:03.199 --> 29:04.033
Hey. Shut up.

29:05.034 --> 29:06.745
Your breath smells like shit.

29:12.876 --> 29:13.710
Hey.

29:14.252 --> 29:15.670
I'm curious.

29:16.254 --> 29:17.589
Are you dating Su-ho?

29:17.672 --> 29:19.716
Fuck, what's this bullshit?

29:19.799 --> 29:22.051
I mean, that's how relationships work.

29:22.135 --> 29:24.429
There's always give and take.

29:24.512 --> 29:27.265
Su-ho lets you stay at his house.

29:27.348 --> 29:28.641
He gets you a job.

29:30.143 --> 29:32.020
So what did you give him in return?

29:33.354 --> 29:34.564
Don't be ridiculous.

30:07.931 --> 30:09.432
The Battle of Thermopylae.

30:10.558 --> 30:13.269
To defeat a much larger army,

30:14.562 --> 30:16.606
Sparta fought them in a narrow pass.

30:19.275 --> 30:22.987
To fight against many opponents,
you need to utilize the terrain.

30:59.566 --> 31:00.733
What's this?

31:05.113 --> 31:05.947
Si-eun!

31:09.450 --> 31:12.078
Fuck, it's been a while, Yeon Si-eun.

31:13.371 --> 31:14.831
Why are you here? Where's Su-ho?

31:15.373 --> 31:17.250
It's fucking good to see you.

31:17.792 --> 31:18.793
Let's go.

31:20.044 --> 31:21.713
Fuck!

31:21.796 --> 31:23.423
What are you doing? Grab him!

31:24.883 --> 31:27.385
What's going on? Where's Ahn Su-ho?

31:31.306 --> 31:32.265
God!

31:39.147 --> 31:39.981
You go first!

31:42.025 --> 31:42.984
I'll get the police!

31:46.613 --> 31:47.614
Son of a bitch!

31:49.449 --> 31:51.075
Hurry up!

31:51.159 --> 31:52.285
Get them!

31:52.368 --> 31:54.162
Please come right away.

31:54.996 --> 31:56.831
They're going to fuck us up!

31:56.915 --> 31:59.626
- Hey!
- Yes, they're coming after me!

32:00.543 --> 32:01.794
Where are you going?

32:02.587 --> 32:03.630
Yeon Si-eun!

32:16.893 --> 32:17.936
Son of a bitch!

32:21.522 --> 32:22.941
You fucker.

32:36.913 --> 32:38.706
That hurts!

32:52.428 --> 32:54.430
Hey. Wait a minute.

32:56.557 --> 32:57.725
Hey, hold on.

32:57.809 --> 32:58.935
Wait a minute!

32:59.727 --> 33:01.729
Hell yeah!

33:06.901 --> 33:07.902
Who are you?

33:07.986 --> 33:09.320
The Foul King?

33:16.327 --> 33:17.787
Are you Yeong-bin's friend?

33:22.542 --> 33:23.876
That won't help you.

33:46.315 --> 33:48.526
You're using a tool, you son of a bitch?

33:50.987 --> 33:52.864
Fucking coward.

34:05.376 --> 34:06.210
Enough.

34:11.090 --> 34:12.050
Just let him go.

34:14.594 --> 34:16.387
- What?
- Si-eun isn't involved.

34:16.471 --> 34:17.805
I said let him go.

34:18.973 --> 34:19.974
I only need Su-ho.

34:20.058 --> 34:21.642
That's your business.

34:23.644 --> 34:24.812
This is mine.

34:31.778 --> 34:34.238
Fuck! I told you to stop.

34:36.699 --> 34:38.242
You crazy fucker.

34:42.121 --> 34:42.955
Hey.

34:44.791 --> 34:45.625
What?

34:45.708 --> 34:47.794
We're all here to help you, asshole.

34:50.463 --> 34:51.547
So he's your friend.

34:54.008 --> 34:55.009
What about us?

35:14.153 --> 35:15.988
Didn't I tell you

35:16.072 --> 35:18.783
to know your place?

35:18.866 --> 35:20.159
You fucker.

35:25.373 --> 35:27.208
Hit that fucker more!

35:28.459 --> 35:29.961
You son of a bitch.

35:33.631 --> 35:35.633
You fucking dog!

35:37.051 --> 35:38.427
Just pound him.

35:45.434 --> 35:46.352
Hey, Beom-seok.

35:55.236 --> 35:57.029
Let's reschedule the Ahn Su-ho fight.

35:58.698 --> 36:01.033
I've already promoted it
a lot on my channel.

36:05.329 --> 36:07.582
Transfer the money for today, okay?

36:08.082 --> 36:09.375
I got you one punk.

36:20.928 --> 36:21.804
Fuck!

36:21.888 --> 36:24.182
Fuck, did you think we were pushovers?

36:24.265 --> 36:25.391
My jaw still hurts.

36:25.474 --> 36:27.310
My jaw! You son of a bitch.

36:27.393 --> 36:28.853
Hit him more. Fuck.

36:34.233 --> 36:35.234
Hey!

36:35.318 --> 36:36.777
The bitch called the cops!

36:36.861 --> 36:38.988
Hurry up!

36:39.697 --> 36:41.240
Fuck! Let's go!

36:41.324 --> 36:42.867
Let's get out of here!

36:54.670 --> 36:55.504
Hey.

36:56.672 --> 36:58.132
You thought you won, didn't you?

37:27.245 --> 37:28.246
Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

37:32.124 --> 37:32.959
Si-eun.

40:27.007 --> 40:28.759
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

40:28.843 --> 40:30.302
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

40:30.803 --> 40:34.140
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
